Type: Package
Package: meddecide
Title: Medical Decision and Reliability Analysis for 'jamovi'
Version: 1.1.4
Date: 2026-11-08
Authors@R: person(given = "Serdar", family = "Balci", role = c("aut",
 "cre", "cph"), email = "serdarbalci@serdarbalci.com", comment =
 c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7852-3851"))
Maintainer: Serdar Balci <serdarbalci@serdarbalci.com>
Description: Medical decision analysis for clinicians and pathologists,
 implemented as a 'jamovi' module. Diagnostic test accuracy (sensitivity,
 specificity, predictive values at a chosen prevalence and likelihood ratios
 with exact intervals and an explicit zero-cell rule, Fagan nomograms),
 comparison and combination of tests, co-testing and sequential testing, and
 analysis without a gold standard (latent class models). Receiver operating
 characteristic (ROC) analysis with optimal cut-points, partial area under the
 curve, DeLong comparisons, net reclassification and integrated discrimination
 improvement, calibration and frozen-model validation. Decision curve analysis
 and LASSO logistic prediction models. Interrater reliability (Cohen's,
 Fleiss' and weighted kappa, Krippendorff's alpha, Gwet's AC1/AC2, intraclass
 correlation, specific agreement), and sample-size and power calculators for
 kappa studies. For comments, suggestions, feature requests or reporting bugs,
 please open an issue at
 <https://github.com/sbalci/ClinicoPathJamoviModule/issues/>.
